VITE_FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/xnjqwyrv

# Spotify credentials are deliberately absent here.
#
# This file is tracked in git, and VITE_-prefixed values are compiled into the
# public bundle — so it is the wrong place for either. Production reads
# SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID / SPOTIFY_CLIENT_SECRET / SPOTIFY_REFRESH_TOKEN from the
# host's environment variables at request time (Vercel: Project → Settings →
# Environment Variables), where api/spotify.ts picks them up.
#
# The Formspree endpoint above stays: it is a public form URL, not a secret,
# and the contact form needs it inlined at build time.
